            "ev:a58185911f7a27745055617a6a74b95cab8535f15dfe35ba665abf0f18629309"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/technical/archiving-and-compression-in-mongodb-tools"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Restore a gzip-compressed directory with mongorestore --gzip; restore a gzip-compressed archive with both --gzip and --archive=<file>. The tools do not require a separate manual decompression step for these inputs. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/database-tools/mongorestore.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:f5095049be5d6d1efd86fc8665a473750eec6d443954f467611892def3f19cff",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
