            "ev:ff3a23f7c551e4bcec3820e3e030e79f1326ccc7ace6f8eba863198d2eb29076"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo-tools/blob/master/mongodump/options.go",
            "https://forums.percona.com/t/percona-logical-backup-slower-than-mongodump/32030"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mongorestore --numParallelCollections (short option -j) defaults to 4 concurrent collections; --numInsertionWorkersPerCollection defaults to 1 concurrent insertion worker per collection. Increasing insertion workers may improve large restore workloads. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/database-tools/mongorestore.md",
          "note": null,
