          "text": "mongodump --archive=<file> writes a single binary archive; bare --archive writes stdout. mongorestore --archive=<file> reads an archive, and bare --archive reads stdin. A mongodump --archive | mongorestore --archive pipeline can stream the data. (medium confidence)",
